Z||000000||Lou Christopher||08-25-2001||08:08 PM||||I need some advice on radiators. I have a 350 in a 84 SE coupe.  The last hot spell caused it to overheat and I do not want to run it in this marginal condition.  Should I buy a two core aluminum, four core aluminum, is there something from a used car that would work?  I also would appreciate advice on a supplier. Please do not tell me to call archie, I did E mail- no response.<BR>       Thanks<BR>              Lou Christopher||||reg||1
